WEBVTT

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:12.960
I heard from Mr. Rizzo that the chef here is quite talented.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.440
Sorry for the wait.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.080
This is tonight's antipasto misto.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:32.810
Please take your time to savor it.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.830
See? It looks delicious.

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.430
Indeed.

00:00:55.960 --> 00:00:57.090
What's wrong?

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:58.880
Nothing...

00:00:58.880 --> 00:00:59.900
Waiter!

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:00.900
Yes, sir?

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:08.150
Why do all the employees here wear spectacles?

00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:11.170
Well, that's this restaurant's trademark.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.070
Huh?

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:19.090
<i>This mysterious restaurant is on a road just a little ways from the center of Rome.</i>

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:04.600
Ring

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.470
What are those?

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:14.790
Oh, those are photographs taken when this restaurant opened.

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:19.060
The staff has changed a little since then.

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:22.140
That man wasn't wearing spectacles.

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:24.260
Yes, that's why he left.

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:26.170
Wait, he was fired?!

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.190
Of course not. That's not grounds for that.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:31.910
But the owner is a curious one.

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:36.030
It's one thing to have a wife who likes bespectacled gentlemen, it's another to open a place like this.

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:40.570
Well, anyway, this wine is truly delectable, Gigi.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.250
He treats his wife like a goddess.

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.830
She truly met a wonderful man to make her husband.

00:03:48.530 --> 00:03:51.330
<i>Look at her, smiling like that...</i>

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:53.450
Are you not feeling well?

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:55.710
No, no!

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:57.960
Feel free to speak your mind about anything.

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:03.450
If you're a friend of the Madam, you're a friend of ours.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.070
Thank you. I will do just that.

00:04:08.180 --> 00:04:14.070
<i>Man... Now I can't tell them I'm really her daughter.</i>

00:04:15.890 --> 00:04:18.430
Yeah, it's really comfortable living here.

00:04:18.430 --> 00:04:21.340
She's taking care of all my living expenses.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:25.610
Though she did break her promise to meet and talk.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.710
Well, she is really busy.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:34.900
Hey, Grandma... There's a guy I really like.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:39.060
But I can't tell if it's love or what...

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:43.130
I'm not really good at talking about these sorts of things.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.920
Why don't you talk to Olga?

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:49.680
She's your mother, plus you're all the way there, in Rome.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:57.200
<i>My grandmother was the one who suggested I go to Rome.</i>

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:01.850
<i>I know it's because she wanted me to make up with her.</i>

00:05:01.850 --> 00:05:05.240
<i>I get that she's busy.</i>

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.480
<i>Well, if I'm staying here in Rome,</i>

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.780
<i>I should probably look for a job.</i>

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.580
<i>But, what sort of job should I look for?</i>

00:05:21.580 --> 00:05:24.920
<i>I just moved here without thinking things through.</i>

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:35.450
They're closed today.

00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:40.770
Lovely.

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:48.650
Shall we go get some food, Francesco?

00:05:48.650 --> 00:05:50.800
Sure, Grandpa.

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.780
How about that panini place?

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:55.290
I wonder if they have my usual.

00:05:55.290 --> 00:05:56.290
Hmm?

00:05:56.930 --> 00:05:57.970
What's that?

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:04.590
Hey!

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.130
Hey!

00:06:12.090 --> 00:06:13.600
Luciano!

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.600
Nonno, who's she?

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.960
She's a friend of the owner's wife.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:23.480
For some reason, she's been coming to eat with the staff every day at the restaurant.

00:06:25.720 --> 00:06:26.990
Your grandson?

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:32.280
I'm Francesco.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.780
Nice to meet you.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:37.850
I'm Nicoletta.

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.630
Don't believe everything your grandfather says about me.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:43.290
Are you hungry?

00:06:43.890 --> 00:06:45.650
Oh, it's Gigi!

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:47.060
Buon giorno.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:52.060
Are you always on this bench?

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:57.310
Sheesh... Why can't they just let me relax on my day off?

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:09.720
Put that all in, too. We'll add in salt and pepper.

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:11.690
You're good at cooking, miss.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:15.530
It's because I used to help my grandma cook since I was about your age.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:18.370
Your grandma? Not your mother?

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:22.020
That's right. I learned how to cook from my grandma.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:23.410
Wow...

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.170
Buono!

00:07:30.960 --> 00:07:33.050
Well? Change your mind about me at all?

00:07:33.290 --> 00:07:35.600
Not bad, for an amateur.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:36.890
I like it.

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.200
<i>He spoke.</i>

00:07:38.730 --> 00:07:40.890
How long are you in town?

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:44.170
Planning to stay in Rome forever?

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:45.910
I don't think I could.

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:48.280
What do your parents say about this?

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:52.850
My daddy's always taking business trips.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:55.370
Oh, that must be tough.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.200
In any case, look for a job.

00:07:58.200 --> 00:08:00.230
You can't just be here for fun.

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:02.830
You've got to take it seriously-

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:04.880
Save the speech, I'm already looking!

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:06.080
Looking!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.870
Don't copy me!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.870
Don't copy her!

00:08:07.870 --> 00:08:09.240
OK!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.260
Claudio's not coming today?

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:25.650
Maybe, since it's his day off, he's treating his wife and kids!

00:08:25.650 --> 00:08:26.560
No?

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:29.770
Hey!

00:08:30.670 --> 00:08:33.280
Wow, this pasta is actually edible.

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.080
What was that all about?

00:08:38.600 --> 00:08:43.270
Sounds like Nicoletta is spending a lot of time at the restaurant.

00:08:43.270 --> 00:08:47.750
You never know what to expect from her. She's still a kid.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:50.730
Why don't you invite her over sometime?

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.760
Since she's your friend and all.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.650
To be honest, I don't know how to connect to her.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:09:01.580
In my mind, she's still that little girl I knew years ago.

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:04.110
Just treat her normally.

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:06.670
Don't worry so much. It's not like you.

00:09:07.430 --> 00:09:08.730
Thank you.

00:09:16.650 --> 00:09:18.860
What's with Luciano?

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:21.580
He treats me like a little kid.

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:28.970
<i>Though it's true, I've never really thought about my future.</i>

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:37.700
<i>I really should think about my future.</i>

00:09:39.490 --> 00:09:43.450
<i>But, for the time being, love is just as important!</i>

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.840
Buon giorno, Nicoletta.

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:49.300
Buon giorno.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.020
Buon giorno.

00:09:52.730 --> 00:09:55.570
<i>Is this love?</i>

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.070
<i>I really don't know yet.</i>

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.740
You again?

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:06.360
<i>Like this Luciano guy who does nothing but complain...</i>

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:11.330
I'll walk you home.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:20.530
<i>If he suddenly became really kind to me, would I fall in love with him over that?</i>

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:31.000
They said it wasn't gonna rain today...

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:33.270
Shall I call you a cab?

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:35.210
I'll be fine if I run!

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:38.580
I'd be fine doing that, but you...

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.500
Use it. You'll both fit.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.200
Thanks.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.570
Thank you, Luciano.

00:10:48.570 --> 00:10:50.170
I'm loaning it to Claudio.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:52.350
Now take her home before the sky really opens up!

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.090
What a nice guy.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:10:59.350
Isn't he?

00:11:03.880 --> 00:11:09.020
That's true. Gigi is somewhat strange.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:13.140
But he's a good guy, too.

00:11:17.520 --> 00:11:20.010
What's your wife like, Claudio?

00:11:28.740 --> 00:11:30.750
I don't have one, actually.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.750
But... that ring...

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:38.310
There's a reason I wear this.

00:11:38.310 --> 00:11:43.750
There are some customers who try and pursue me for real.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:46.210
They'll start talking about marriage and the like.

00:11:46.680 --> 00:11:49.530
So, this is a countermeasure against that.

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:54.140
My wife and I separated years ago.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.320
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.980
<i>He opened up to me.</i>

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.560
<i>I hate the whole idea of adultery.</i>

00:12:23.010 --> 00:12:25.650
<i>I'd never bring up the idea of marriage, though...</i>

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:38.060
<i>My wife and I separated years ago.</i>

00:12:38.060 --> 00:12:43.510
<i>There are some customers who try and pursue me for real.</i>

00:12:43.510 --> 00:12:46.990
<i>So, this is a countermeasure against that.</i>

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:51.960
Here you go.

00:12:53.620 --> 00:12:55.150
Uh, umm...

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:56.170
Have a seat.

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.180
OK.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:00.630
Thank you very much.

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:02.740
My...

00:13:04.880 --> 00:13:07.590
This smells lovely. What is it?

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.170
I bought it at a shop nearby.

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.070
I see.

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.620
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.650
<i>I can't take my eyes off of him.</i>

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:24.870
<i>He's so much older than I am... I've never felt like this before.</i>

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:37.970
Umm...

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:41.960
I want to try and see if this is all right or not.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:48.590
I know I like you, but I can't tell if it's real...

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:54.110
Hold on a second...

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.080
Umm...

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:01.120
I mustn't.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:12.120
<i>I think... he's a real gentleman.</i>

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:15.590
Nicoletta, it's been a while!

00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:17.430
I brought you some chocolates!

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:25.450
Keep your hands off my Claudio.

00:14:25.450 --> 00:14:27.190
Why's he yours?!

00:14:27.190 --> 00:14:30.390
All the gentlemen there belong to me.

00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:36.040
I'm truly sorry for being in your friend's apartment at such a late hour.

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.120
It's fine. Have a seat.

00:14:38.730 --> 00:14:42.160
I know that she dragged you here against your will.

00:14:42.160 --> 00:14:43.650
No, but...

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:46.650
I'll let the two of you talk.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:49.160
Ah... All right.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:52.620
You're not serious, are you?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:57.800
You're serious?

00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:00.620
Yes. I'm single, so who cares!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.980
Then why not go after Luciano? He's single!

00:15:03.980 --> 00:15:05.130
Why?

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.980
Then, Teo?

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:10.680
What is this? It's like you don't want me going after Claudio for some reason.

00:15:10.680 --> 00:15:17.480
Well... I understand, but Claudio doesn't know how to handle a woman's advances.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:21.230
Say, why don't you move back to your grandmother's?

00:15:21.230 --> 00:15:22.580
What the hell?!

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:26.030
You're young. There's no need to rush things.

00:15:26.030 --> 00:15:29.390
You should focus on getting a job, and your future.

00:15:29.390 --> 00:15:33.570
Enough! Why does everyone treat me like a little kid?

00:15:33.770 --> 00:15:34.540
Huh?

00:15:34.540 --> 00:15:36.700
I've thought about all that already!

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:39.170
But I don't know what I should do!

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:41.360
I don't know what I'd be good at.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:44.550
<i>You're good at cooking, miss.</i>

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:52.830
Hey, why'd you go quiet all of a sudden?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.240
Hey, I have a favor to ask.

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:55.930
Huh?

00:15:55.930 --> 00:16:01.800
If you help me out, I'll reconsider telling your husband that I'm your daughter.

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:13.480
I'm Nicoletta and I'll be working as an apprentice here, starting today.

00:16:13.480 --> 00:16:15.020
I look forward to working with you.

00:16:15.020 --> 00:16:17.220
Since Lorenzo said it was fine,

00:16:17.220 --> 00:16:18.700
it's OK with me.

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:22.830
But promise me you won't leave the kitchen.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:24.960
Of course not!

00:16:30.930 --> 00:16:34.990
So you've always had an interest in cooking, huh?

00:16:34.990 --> 00:16:37.910
They said you even went to cooking school for a bit.

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:42.390
Yes, but I had never thought about it as a career.

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:45.420
So what made you change your mind?

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:48.050
I couldn't figure out what I wanted to do,

00:16:48.050 --> 00:16:49.940
but I knew I wanted to be independent.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:54.450
I plan on using this opportunity to learn everything I can about cooking.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:55.950
Excellent.

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:59.240
Say, you give cooking classes at your home, don't you?

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:01.200
Can I join in?

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.870
I'd love that.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:05.950
Man, there's no pancetta.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.840
Giuseppe swore up and down he'd get it, too...

00:17:08.840 --> 00:17:13.410
That's no good. We can call, but it takes them a while to deliver it.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.930
How about I go and get it?

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.370
Just tell me where to go.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.140
Claudio. You heard her.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.850
Please escort her there.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:40.290
Umm...

00:17:40.290 --> 00:17:43.420
Sorry about last night, for doing that to you.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.600
But, I want to let you know that I'm serious.

00:17:49.600 --> 00:17:51.490
I don't regret what I did.

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:59.340
It's fine. I'll lay off a bit.

00:17:59.620 --> 00:18:02.210
Nicoletta, I...

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:05.140
I'm serious about learning how to cook.

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:10.350
I didn't start working at the restaurant just because of you.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:14.630
I want to try and pursue something I may be good at.

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.850
I don't want to always depend on Olga.

00:18:17.630 --> 00:18:20.380
I want to be truly independent someday.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:24.800
Then, I'll become a great woman, and get back at <i>her</i>!

00:18:25.590 --> 00:18:28.520
I've had enough of people treating me like a kid!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:32.380
Please give it your all. I'll support you.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:35.380
Sure. I can use your support more than ever!

00:18:41.750 --> 00:18:42.860
Ladies first.

00:18:42.860 --> 00:18:43.880
Thank you.

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:51.770
<i>It's so great to be working in the same place as him!</i>

00:18:52.860 --> 00:18:55.350
Gabrielle's coming tonight, right?

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.960
I'll have to make a really grand dolce, then.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:02.120
Gabrielle? Could that be someone special?

00:19:12.760 --> 00:19:14.250
Buonasera.

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:17.610
Gabrielle is here.

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:18.760
Got it.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:22.170
Hey, is Gabrielle a VIP or something?

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:25.120
Yes. She's Claudio's ex-wife.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.370
I wanna see!

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.760
Stay out of sight.

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:38.770
<i>She has such beautiful skin.</i>

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.570
That's his ex-wife?

00:19:41.570 --> 00:19:42.350
Yes.

00:19:43.360 --> 00:19:46.660
<i>Well, it is his "ex"-wife.</i>

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:55.670
Good work today, Nicoletta.

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:56.640
See you tomorrow!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:08.760
When are you going to stop wearing that ring?

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.930
I won't order you to do it, though.

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.320
Anyway, see you later.

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.950
I'm sorry I interrupted your conversation.

00:20:35.950 --> 00:20:37.140
Nothing of the sort.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:43.500
<i>Claudio...</i>

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:48.070
<i>Could he still have feelings for his ex-wife?</i>

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:58.210
The restaurant is located on a street in Rome.

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:01.380
Its name is casetta dell'orso.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:16.240
Paradiso

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:11.150
She's my mother.

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:15.020
I said it.

00:21:15.250 --> 00:21:16.250
What?!

00:22:54.950 --> 00:23:02.450
Watch again next time... I said it.
